  "title_zh": "习近平主持亚太经合组织第三十三次领导人非正式会议并发表重要讲话",
  "title_en": "Xi Jinping Chairs the 33rd APEC Economic Leaders' Meeting and Delivers an Important Speech",
  "summary_zh": "11月19日上午，国家主席习近平在深圳主持亚太经合组织第三十三次领导人非正式会议，并发表题为《建设亚太共同体，续写“亚太奇迹”新篇章》的重要讲话。",
  "summary_en": "On the morning of November 19, President Xi Jinping chaired the 33rd APEC Economic Leaders' Meeting in Shenzhen and delivered an important speech titled \"Building an Asia-Pacific Community and Writing a New Chapter of the Asia-Pacific Miracle.\"",
